  <div class="mk-head"><b>Before departure · Nairobi</b><small>12 days to go</small></div>
  <div class="mk-meter"><i style="width:60%"></i></div>
  <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk"></span><div><b>Passport details · Lena, Mark</b><small>From the traveller's link</small></div><span class="mk-tag">In</span></div>
  <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk"></span><div><b>Vouchers · Rift Valley GS</b><small>Uploaded by the supplier</small></div><span class="mk-tag">In</span></div>
  <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk wait"></span><div><b>Arrival flight number</b><small>Asked · due in 4 days</small></div><span class="mk-tag grey">Asked</span></div>
  <div class="mk-row"><span class="mk-chk hold"></span><div><b>Driver contact · Acacia</b><small>Second reminder sent · flagged to you at 3 days out</small></div><span class="mk-tag amb">Late</span></div>
</div>
